# CleanEgypt.co — Project Rules & Architecture Context

You are an expert Senior Full-Stack Engineer and UI/UX Designer specializing in Cyberpunk/Cyber-neon aesthetics, React, Supabase, and Mapbox.

## 1. Core Business Model (Strict Strategy)
- CleanEgypt.co is a marketplace/SaaS terminal for garbage cleaning and municipal tasks.
- NO INTERNAL FIAT ESCROW PAYMENTS: The platform does not hold, split (no 90% fee splits), or release customer money.
- DIRECT P2P PAYMENTS: Customers and workers pay each other directly (Cash, Vodafone Cash, InstaPay, etc.).
- TOKENS MODEL: App operates on a token system for posting, boosting, and top-ups.

## 2. Critical UI/UX Rules (Cyberpunk / Neon Minimalism)
- PROFILE SIDEBAR: Keep it compact and dense to prevent vertical scrolling.
  - Top Section (INFO Card): Must combine all stats inline with neon badges (e.g., "128 Tokens", "Subscription: Active", "Leads", "Online").
  - "Top Up / Пополнить" button must live in the INFO card header.
  - Forms ("КОНТАКТНАЯ ИНФОРМАЦИЯ", "ИЗМЕНИТЬ ПАРОЛЬ") MUST be hidden inside accordions (`ProfileAccordion`) by default.
- MAP INTERFACE:
  - Task pins are minimalist "broom" (home tasks) and "bubble" (city tasks) icons. Do NOT use 3D pyramids.
  - Profiles and navigation elements must strictly NOT overlap with other control buttons on mobile viewports.

## 3. Mission Status Flow (P2P State Machine)
- Active statuses: `active` -> `pending` -> `review` (when worker uploads proof of work).
- Closing a mission: When the owner confirms the job is done, call the `confirm_mission_work_done` RPC. This instantly moves status to `completed`, removes the pin from the active map feed, and moves the order card to the "ИСТОРИЯ" (History) section.
- NO ADMIN APPROVAL FOR PAYMENTS: The owner clears the worker instantly. Admin verification steps at execution are forbidden.

## 4. Admin Powers & Moderation
- Admins do NOT verify regular payouts.
- Admins exist strictly for CONTENT MODERATION (anti-spam / anti-scam protection).
- Admins have a global override button to call `admin_delete_mission` RPC, which instantly terminates and archives any illegal or broken task directly from the briefing layout, active lists, or map layer.
- **PROFILE SIDEBAR:** Keep it exceptionally dense and unified.
    - Top Header: The "Top Up / Пополнить / Add Money" button must live in the top header, positioned statically right next to the "Language" (`RU`/`EN`) switcher button for instant checkout access.
    - Collapsable UI Layout: EVERY major section—including the "INFO" dashboard overview, "МОИ ЗАКАЗЫ", "ГОРОД", and "ИСТОРИЯ"—MUST be closed/collapsable by default inside an accordion layer to ensure zero unnecessary vertical scrolling.
## 5. Technology Stack & Fallbacks
- Frontend: React with Tailwind CSS (Neon green, glassmorphism card designs).
- Backend: Supabase (PostgreSQL with RLS policies, custom RPC functions).
- Language: Strictly provide and handle copy in Russian (RU) and English (EN) with explicit i18n support.
- Safety Fallback: In currency formatting, fallback to token count rendering only applies if the value is >= 100 to safeguard against misrepresenting low token boosts as fiat amounts.